    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48865" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θιβρός</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θιμβρός</span></b>  (v.l. in
		<i><span class="en">
			Nic.
			<u>Th.</u>
			35
		</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hot</i>,
